        "page": "14",
        "pdfPage": 14,
        "quote": "Aya 23 models tend to\nproduce less toxic generations describing Asians, Latinx, but have a much higher chance to produce\ntoxic descriptions of Blacks and Whites, especially for women."
      }
    },
